    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d191">

                <pb facs="0306" n="140" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg140"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1804</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Reinsch </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-13T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 13, 1917, 3
                        p.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your September 7, 5 p.m. The Chinese Minister on behalf of his Government has
                    requested a loan of 100,000,000 dollars. The matter is having careful
                    consideration and the Minister has been told that for the present a loan of
                    25,000,000 dollars may probably be had.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
